  "content_id": "16136237",
  "title": "Sui Network Fees",
  "description": "Sui Network  – Next-Gen Smart Transactions\nSui is a new Layer 1 blockchain designed for extremely fast throughput, focusing on asset owner...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ25YJGDRF3AGCWZAB3FYAE\">Sui Network – Next-Gen Smart Transactions</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Sui is a new Layer 1 blockchain designed for extremely fast throughput, focusing on asset ownership, gaming, and microtransactions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ25YJG5WKF2SDNYR5YE078\">How Sui Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are calculated based on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Computation resources used</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Storage impact</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network load</b><br>Fees are paid in <b>SUI tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge estimates the fee dynamically, balancing performance and price based on real-time network conditions.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ25YJGVN986PE024VAQJ5S\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Prioritizes speed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Everyday balance</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Lower fee, slower settlement</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Advanced users can tweak fees</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ25YJG7XZTEQZ91JWPV5X0\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Sui transactions usually cost <b>$0.002 to $0.01 USD</b>, depending on transaction complexity.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ25YJGV1G2X4398ZXS96AY\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Sui’s cutting-edge tech means you can move assets and interact with apps quickly and cheaply. Edge Wallet’s automatic fee adjustment lets you enjoy Sui without worrying about complex fee mechanics.</p>",
